        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchiambira nyo alavyadzi-sadaka, “Mwimwi mu atakatifu kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu, na miyo hino piya ni mitakatifu. Zo feza na zahabu ni sadaka za hiyari kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa akare enu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ziikenito hadi ndiphozipima mbere za alavyadzi-sadaka akulu, Alawi na vilongozi a mbari za Iziraeli hiko Jerusalemu kahi za vyumba vya hazina vya nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho, alavyadzi-sadaka na Alawi achihala jukumu ra kuhala zo feza na zahabu na yo miyo ili aiphirike Jerusalemu kpwenye nyumba ya Mlungu wehu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
