          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iriphofika siku ya kumi na mbiri ya mwezi wa kpwandza, huchiandza kuuka kula muho Ahava kuphiya Jerusalemu. Mlungu wehu wakala phamwenga naswi na achihurinda na maadui na akora mumo njirani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naswi hwafika Jerusalemu na huchioya kpwa muda wa siku tahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inafika siku ya ne huchipima zo feza na zahabu na vyo vitu kahi ya nyumba ya Mlungu wehu, huchimupha mlavyadzi-sadaka Meremothi mwana wa Uriya na Eliazari mwana wa Finehasi phamwenga na Alawi airi, Jozabadi mwana wa Jeshuwa na Noadia mwana wa Binui. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chila chitu chaolangbwa na chichipimwa na yo isabu ichiandikpwa phapho hipho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha nyo atu ariouya kula Babeli achimlavira Mlungu wa Iziraeli sadaka za kuochwa. Aho alavya ndzau kumi na mbiri kpwa ajili ya Aiziraeli osi, maturume mirongo tisiya na sita na ana ngʼondzi mirongo sabaa na sabaa ndenje kumi na mbiri kama sadaka ya kuusa dambi. Nyama aha osi alaviwa dza sadaka za kuochwa kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha achiapha nyo akulu a maliwali a mfalume na maliwali a ngʼambo ya muho Yufurati go malagizo ga mfalume. Nao achiaterya Aiziraeli na kazi zosi za nyumba ya Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.36"
            ]
          }
        }
